Note: this VS Code extension is currently BSL'd by default during the
moat-build window. Consider relicensing to Apache 2.0 if the extension
graduates to "core client integration" status alongside the SDK — that
would match its functional role (a customer-installable IDE tool that
mirrors the SDK's positioning). Tracked separately.

This LICENSE file exists because JSON / TOML / lock files have no
standardized comment syntax for SPDX-License-Identifier headers.
license-check.yml reads this file's SPDX line as the directory-level
declaration.

